<title>USA: Linn-Mar CSD, Iowa., won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Linn-Mar CSD, Iowa., won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust said it won $7 million of Linn-Mar CSD, Iowa, general obligation school bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.57 percent.</p>
